WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Bik Chagi (Bandal Chagi)

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Step 1: knee up

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Step 2: turn the standing foot, extend

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 3: the whole kick

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:21.900
On the pad: hit with the instep, then pull the leg back
